WEBVTT

01:39.760 --> 01:40.680
Ms. Ji,

01:41.560 --> 01:44.040
this will be your room in the workshop.

01:44.120 --> 01:45.400
From now on,

01:45.480 --> 01:47.240
if you need anything
related to dyeing and weaving,

01:47.320 --> 01:48.480
feel free to ask me anytime.

02:10.800 --> 02:12.320
- Yingying!
- Yingying!

02:12.400 --> 02:13.680
- Yingying.
- You're finally here!

02:13.760 --> 02:14.760
It really is you!

02:15.280 --> 02:17.200
Yingying, how have you been?

02:17.800 --> 02:19.320
Did Sheng Fengze ever harm you?

02:21.440 --> 02:22.920
Alright, you three chat.

02:23.000 --> 02:23.840
I'll keep watch for you.

02:25.480 --> 02:27.000
- Sit down.
- Have a seat.

02:32.680 --> 02:33.600
I'll keep it brief.

02:34.520 --> 02:37.120
Sometimes,
you have to go along to get along.

02:37.960 --> 02:39.520
But Yizhou is my home.

02:39.600 --> 02:41.360
I will never betray my true self.

02:42.800 --> 02:43.920
We all understand.

02:44.000 --> 02:45.640
You only became the princess consort

02:46.160 --> 02:47.200
and started weaving Nanzhao brocade

02:47.280 --> 02:48.400
to save our lives.

02:49.080 --> 02:51.440
We know this is only a temporary measure.

02:51.520 --> 02:52.840
You would never actually do it.

02:54.280 --> 02:56.000
I will never become a princess consort.

02:57.880 --> 02:59.520
But weaving Nanzhao brocade

02:59.600 --> 03:00.920
is what I promised the king of Nanzhao,

03:01.920 --> 03:03.480
a one-year term, no less.

03:03.560 --> 03:04.760
But…

03:07.280 --> 03:09.200
are we really going to weave for him?

03:09.280 --> 03:11.480
The Nanzhao people kidnapped us,

03:11.560 --> 03:13.600
treated us as prisoners, captives.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.480
Should we just surrender to this fate

03:15.560 --> 03:17.040
and work for them?

03:17.120 --> 03:18.880
But what else can we do?

03:18.960 --> 03:20.160
Not weaving will lead to our deaths.

03:24.760 --> 03:25.680
Yingying,

03:27.320 --> 03:29.040
this isn't like you.

03:30.000 --> 03:32.800
Have you changed since coming to Nanzhao?

03:33.760 --> 03:36.160
Did Sheng Fengze
feed you some kind of mind poison?

03:37.040 --> 03:39.080
We thought you came here with a plan

03:39.160 --> 03:40.280
to lead us in rebellion,

03:40.360 --> 03:42.320
not to make us into slaves.

03:50.680 --> 03:52.600
Right now,

03:53.560 --> 03:55.400
we're like lambs to the slaughter,

03:57.040 --> 03:58.560
completely helpless.

03:59.640 --> 04:00.880
Our only option is to gamble.

04:01.480 --> 04:02.600
So,

04:03.320 --> 04:05.640
I made a deal with the king of Nanzhao.

04:08.840 --> 04:10.880
It's Liu. Liu got beaten up!

04:10.960 --> 04:12.000
Quick, let's go!

04:15.520 --> 04:17.040
Useless fool!

04:17.680 --> 04:19.200
Do you know how much these dyes are worth?

04:20.720 --> 04:23.840
Delaying the brocade for Prince Bai,
you deserve death! Beat him!

04:23.920 --> 04:25.360
Stop!

04:25.440 --> 04:26.280
Stop it!

04:26.360 --> 04:27.560
- Stop!
- Get up!

04:27.640 --> 04:28.680
What?

04:28.760 --> 04:30.200
Do you want to get beaten too?

04:30.720 --> 04:31.560
Let's discuss it!

04:31.640 --> 04:32.480
Let's discuss it!

04:32.560 --> 04:33.600
Stop!

04:39.560 --> 04:42.000
Your King personally made a deal with me.

04:42.600 --> 04:43.800
This is written in his own hand.

04:44.520 --> 04:46.560
We weave brocade for him,
and he will send us home.

04:47.160 --> 04:49.040
We are craftsmen invited by Nanzhao,

04:49.120 --> 04:50.400
not slaves!

04:50.480 --> 04:52.360
Are you going to defy your king's orders?

04:54.120 --> 04:55.720
Isn't she the future
princess consort of Prince Bai?

04:56.600 --> 04:57.440
Don't try to fool me.

04:57.520 --> 04:58.960
I'm not easily scared.

04:59.680 --> 05:00.640
If you don't believe it,

05:00.720 --> 05:02.360
then call your king here.

05:02.440 --> 05:03.640
Let him decide.

05:06.320 --> 05:07.680
Who do you think you are?

05:08.600 --> 05:10.440
Just a bunch of lowly captives!

05:12.560 --> 05:14.640
Do you think you can just meet the king?

05:19.200 --> 05:20.480
Try it.

05:21.000 --> 05:22.600
If anything happens to us

05:22.680 --> 05:23.800
and we can't weave brocade,

05:23.880 --> 05:26.840
your head might hang on the gate tomorrow!

05:34.480 --> 05:36.920
You're truly the future
princess consort of Prince Bai,

05:37.520 --> 05:39.360
always thinking on his behalf.

05:40.520 --> 05:42.760
If Prince Bai can't produce brocade
in a year,

05:42.840 --> 05:44.960
he'll be sent to Tang
to face consequences!

05:45.640 --> 05:47.320
If someone had any backbone,

05:47.400 --> 05:49.080
they would simply refuse to work.

05:49.160 --> 05:53.400
At that point,
they'd die alongside the real culprit!

06:00.200 --> 06:01.480
What are you doing?

06:01.560 --> 06:02.520
No!

06:04.280 --> 06:06.040
You're lucky this time.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.080
- Get out of the way!
- Liu,

06:11.160 --> 06:12.480
don't be scared.

06:13.240 --> 06:14.080
It's alright now.

06:14.680 --> 06:15.720
It's okay.

06:16.560 --> 06:18.720
Ever since he witnessed
the killing that day,

06:18.800 --> 06:20.600
he's been terrified
by the sound of blades being drawn.

06:21.120 --> 06:22.640
They keep using it to scare him.

06:24.640 --> 06:27.080
Is that thing you showed earlier real?

06:27.160 --> 06:29.040
Can we really go back?

06:30.240 --> 06:32.640
That is indeed written
by the king of Nanzhao himself.

06:33.360 --> 06:36.200
Are you afraid Sheng Fengze will be
executed for failing to produce brocade,

06:36.280 --> 06:38.600
and you'll lose your chance
to be a princess consort?

06:38.680 --> 06:39.600
- Shut up!
- You…

06:39.680 --> 06:41.000
Yingying is worried
we'll get dragged into this.

06:41.080 --> 06:42.040
Why are you saying this?

06:42.120 --> 06:43.040
Watch your words!

06:43.560 --> 06:45.280
Everyone can make their own choice,

06:46.520 --> 06:48.480
but I just want to go back alive.

06:49.120 --> 06:52.000
I want to see my mother and brother again.

06:57.760 --> 06:59.440
Let's go. Let's help him back first.

06:59.520 --> 07:00.880
Come on, Liu.

07:06.480 --> 07:07.520
Ms. Ji,

07:10.040 --> 07:11.040
the Qingping Officer's people

07:12.000 --> 07:13.680
are not easy to deal with.

07:13.760 --> 07:15.160
If I were you,

07:15.680 --> 07:17.000
I'd stay away from them

07:17.560 --> 07:18.680
and focus on weaving brocade.

07:20.440 --> 07:22.520
It's precisely
because I want to focus on brocade

07:23.040 --> 07:24.760
that I can't just sit by.

07:26.960 --> 07:28.280
Brocade comes first,

07:28.360 --> 07:29.760
but people are above the brocade.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.920
The first thing I care about

07:32.440 --> 07:33.440
is people.

07:38.360 --> 07:39.200
Let's go.

07:49.000 --> 07:51.120
Alright, get some rest early.

07:51.200 --> 07:52.880
Whatever it is, leave it for tomorrow.

07:55.960 --> 07:58.760
What have you all been through
these past few days?

08:02.760 --> 08:04.960
Even if Chi Hu stayed,

08:05.720 --> 08:08.440
he couldn't stop Du Yan
from harassing you, right?

08:11.000 --> 08:14.080
That head guard
sent by the Qingping Officer

08:15.280 --> 08:16.560
openly and secretly

08:17.080 --> 08:19.440
humiliates and tortures everyone.

08:21.960 --> 08:24.560
If it's not life-threatening
or related to dyeing,

08:25.880 --> 08:27.520
Chi Hu won't intervene.

08:31.240 --> 08:34.440
So, now, everyone either ends up like San,

08:34.520 --> 08:37.120
angry but helpless,

08:38.000 --> 08:42.720
or like Liu, afraid or numb.

08:43.360 --> 08:45.040
Why is it like this again?

08:53.280 --> 08:54.840
It's the head guard's doing again,
isn't it?

09:03.360 --> 09:04.640
- Who's there?
- Are you awake?

09:05.160 --> 09:06.120
It's me.

09:06.200 --> 09:07.280
It's Shisi.

09:08.000 --> 09:08.920
I'm Shisi.

09:09.000 --> 09:10.040
Coming.

09:10.120 --> 09:11.280
Here.

09:14.240 --> 09:15.560
Why are you here?

09:15.640 --> 09:16.680
Haven't you rested yet?

09:16.760 --> 09:19.520
Well, San felt bad,
so he asked me to bring over two quilts.

09:20.520 --> 09:22.640
- Is it convenient?
- Come in.

09:31.040 --> 09:33.800
It seems this isn't the first time
they've done this.

09:35.200 --> 09:36.840
I need to think of a way to deal with him.

09:38.960 --> 09:41.240
What? Deal with him?

09:43.960 --> 09:45.800
Alright, it's late. Go back and rest.

09:45.880 --> 09:46.720
I…

09:47.560 --> 09:49.120
Thank you for the quilts.

09:52.440 --> 09:53.920
Then, I'll head back first.

09:57.880 --> 09:59.080
Do you have enough quilts on your side?

10:00.240 --> 10:02.200
We do!

10:10.800 --> 10:13.240
Did that look he gave you just now mean

10:13.320 --> 10:14.960
he wants you to keep an eye on me?

10:19.000 --> 10:20.480
Such growing understanding
between you two.

10:21.080 --> 10:22.560
These days,

10:22.640 --> 10:24.120
he's helped me a lot.

10:26.840 --> 10:28.240
Adversity reveals true feelings…

10:33.040 --> 10:35.160
Adversity reveals true feelings.

10:38.920 --> 10:40.920
Then, when the adversity is over,

10:42.600 --> 10:44.720
will the feelings disappear?

10:47.920 --> 10:48.880
No, they won't.

11:00.280 --> 11:01.800
The moon is almost full.

11:02.920 --> 11:04.080
It seems like Mid-Autumn Festival is near.

11:07.120 --> 11:08.480
Mid-Autumn Festival…

11:10.400 --> 11:12.560
Since we left Yizhou,

11:13.480 --> 11:16.720
I've been pulling one silk thread
from my clothes each day.

11:18.360 --> 11:20.240
I tie every ten threads into a bundle.

11:23.640 --> 11:25.360
It's been a month since we left.

11:32.280 --> 11:33.520
Silk threads…

12:31.680 --> 12:32.760
Apply this.

12:36.000 --> 12:38.120
Look at me now.

12:39.080 --> 12:40.480
Can I still harm you?

13:01.920 --> 13:03.520
You came from Yizhou?

13:14.160 --> 13:15.320
How is my family?

13:20.480 --> 13:22.480
Niu Jin is now in charge of Yizhou.

13:25.080 --> 13:26.200
And then?

13:32.480 --> 13:33.800
Niu Jin says

13:35.640 --> 13:37.280
that your Zhao family
colluded with Nanzhao,

13:39.280 --> 13:41.440
leading Nanzhao troops into the city.

13:43.160 --> 13:44.600
He acted first and reported later,

13:46.720 --> 13:48.600
killing everyone in your Zhao family.

13:51.560 --> 13:52.800
Not a single one was spared.

14:48.400 --> 14:50.040
What did Yang Jinglan say to you?

14:52.440 --> 14:53.880
He didn't say anything.

14:55.640 --> 14:57.040
He still doesn't trust me enough.

14:57.680 --> 14:59.920
But I think, about why he came to Nanzhao

15:01.120 --> 15:02.880
and who his informant is,

15:04.280 --> 15:07.720
even if he won't tell me,
he'll surely tell Yingying.

15:10.560 --> 15:12.400
What does he want to say to Ji Yingying?

15:13.520 --> 15:15.960
"Stay safe. Don't worry."

15:16.680 --> 15:17.800
That's all?

15:21.200 --> 15:22.120
That makes sense.

15:22.840 --> 15:24.560
In such a short time,

15:24.640 --> 15:26.360
he wouldn't easily trust you.

15:28.120 --> 15:28.960
Indeed.

15:29.720 --> 15:30.560
Your Highness,

15:31.400 --> 15:33.520
let's take our time
and plan this carefully.

15:34.440 --> 15:35.600
Wait a while

15:36.120 --> 15:38.240
and find another excuse
so I can meet him again.

15:38.760 --> 15:40.040
We'll try once more.

15:43.680 --> 15:44.520
By the way,

15:45.560 --> 15:49.120
did he eat the food and water sent in?

15:50.520 --> 15:52.280
He must have noticed something was wrong.

15:52.800 --> 15:54.560
He only eats the bare minimum

15:54.640 --> 15:56.360
to stay alive.

15:59.080 --> 16:01.120
And you? Did you eat it?

16:02.360 --> 16:04.360
Since I've decided to work with you,

16:04.880 --> 16:07.040
I will trust that in the future,

16:07.120 --> 16:08.080
you'll give me the antidote.

16:10.640 --> 16:12.480
Actually,
there's no such thing as an antidote.

16:13.400 --> 16:14.480
The more you take this drug,

16:14.560 --> 16:15.960
the more you desire it.

16:16.480 --> 16:17.920
If you go even one day without it,

16:18.000 --> 16:20.920
it'll feel like thousands of ants
biting you.

16:21.720 --> 16:22.800
You'll be in unbearable pain.

16:23.840 --> 16:26.480
When the pain becomes too much to bear,

16:26.560 --> 16:28.440
he'll surrender his dignity

16:28.520 --> 16:29.720
and bow to me.

16:33.400 --> 16:35.600
- So, I…
- Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

16:35.680 --> 16:38.440
From today on,
you don't need to take it anymore.

16:38.520 --> 16:39.520
It doesn't matter.

16:40.600 --> 16:42.280
You and I are on the same side.

16:42.920 --> 16:44.400
I won't harm you.

16:47.000 --> 16:47.840
Thank you, Your Highness.

16:53.400 --> 16:55.360
I have one more request.

16:56.000 --> 16:56.840
Say it.

16:59.200 --> 17:00.320
I beg you, Your Highness.

17:00.840 --> 17:04.040
Please be kind to my family you saved.

17:15.599 --> 17:17.160
Since I saved them,

17:17.680 --> 17:19.160
of course, I will treat them well.

17:22.599 --> 17:25.079
Thank you.
I'm willing to serve you loyally!

17:26.480 --> 17:28.720
What else do you want?
Tell me everything at once.

17:28.800 --> 17:30.360
I have no other requests.

17:30.880 --> 17:33.560
I just want to work loyally at your side

17:33.640 --> 17:35.000
and become a person of status in Nanzhao.

17:37.400 --> 17:38.320
After all, this way,

17:38.960 --> 17:40.480
I can still see Yingying
from time to time.

17:58.240 --> 18:00.160
To serve me,

18:01.160 --> 18:02.480
it's not that simple.

18:03.360 --> 18:04.360
He…

18:05.120 --> 18:06.760
must learn to obey.

18:09.640 --> 18:11.400
My shoes are dirty.

18:30.400 --> 18:31.600
I know,

18:33.960 --> 18:35.480
it's not easy

18:36.000 --> 18:37.400
to make someone bow.

18:39.280 --> 18:40.560
Kneel now.

19:44.080 --> 19:46.320
Ms. Ji, someone is looking for you.

19:50.680 --> 19:52.880
What exactly is "Tian Bu Pa"?

19:56.160 --> 19:58.720
Your Nanzhao looms are indeed intricate,

19:58.800 --> 20:01.600
but they can only weave brocade
up to seven inches wide.

20:04.600 --> 20:07.280
The loom we're using is unique to Tang.

20:07.360 --> 20:10.000
The patterns it produces are more refined,

20:10.080 --> 20:12.760
with greater luster
and a smoother texture.

20:23.800 --> 20:25.920
This is Nanzhao tiffany.

20:26.520 --> 20:29.400
Your clothes gave me
the inspiration for this.

20:29.920 --> 20:32.360
Nanzhao's textile industry
has its own characteristics.

20:32.440 --> 20:34.600
Since we're making Nanzhao brocade,

20:34.680 --> 20:36.720
we can learn from
and complement each other.

20:41.720 --> 20:43.120
So,

20:43.200 --> 20:45.440
there's really no such thing
as "Tian Bu Pa".

20:45.520 --> 20:47.640
Why did you lure me here to see all this?

20:48.320 --> 20:50.320
To weave superior Shu brocade,

20:50.400 --> 20:52.520
you need the finest silk,

20:52.600 --> 20:53.920
meticulously dyed,

20:54.960 --> 20:57.840
with exquisite pattern designs
and skilled craftsmanship.

20:59.000 --> 21:01.520
"Tian Bu Pa" is not a type of leaf.

21:02.040 --> 21:04.040
It's a complete process,

21:04.120 --> 21:06.160
a result of everyone's joint efforts.

21:06.840 --> 21:09.240
This is my "Tian Bu Pa".

21:11.400 --> 21:13.960
To distinguish between a good lie
and a bad one,

21:14.040 --> 21:16.760
you need to see if she deceives you
for your benefit

21:16.840 --> 21:18.200
or for hers.

21:18.800 --> 21:22.600
You came because you didn't want
to let any opportunity slip away.

21:22.680 --> 21:24.680
Because you deeply love those silkworms

21:25.400 --> 21:26.320
and the brocade.

21:29.560 --> 21:32.000
I told you, you and I
are not the same kind of person.

21:32.080 --> 21:33.720
We cannot walk the same path.

21:34.240 --> 21:35.640
Go join Sheng Fengze on his path.

21:35.720 --> 21:37.680
I cannot walk the same path as him.

21:43.600 --> 21:44.960
He wants to keep me here,

21:45.480 --> 21:47.080
but I want to go home.

21:48.360 --> 21:50.080
If we cannot produce brocade,

21:50.600 --> 21:51.800
we will all die.

22:01.000 --> 22:03.960
What's this? Emotional blackmail?

22:15.040 --> 22:18.320
Back then,
when my master's wife was taken,

22:19.080 --> 22:20.680
nobody sympathized with my master.

22:22.360 --> 22:25.080
Yingying,
the items you asked for are ready.

22:26.760 --> 22:27.920
Alright.

22:32.520 --> 22:34.200
This is Nanzhao silk

22:34.280 --> 22:35.640
dyed using Yizhou methods.

22:35.720 --> 22:37.680
Take a look and see the difference.

22:40.280 --> 22:43.080
If you don't want to look,
you can throw it away.

22:47.040 --> 22:47.880
Let's go.

23:17.800 --> 23:19.320
Mr. Chi Hu,

23:19.840 --> 23:23.240
I need your help with something.

23:31.400 --> 23:33.360
Ms. Ji, your skills

23:34.080 --> 23:35.360
are truly extraordinary.

23:37.480 --> 23:38.480
But this…

23:39.600 --> 23:41.640
I don't dare accept it.

23:42.880 --> 23:44.440
I never said it was a gift.

23:45.240 --> 23:46.640
The Mid-Autumn Festival is coming soon.

23:47.160 --> 23:48.800
In our hometown,

23:49.320 --> 23:50.880
it's a time for families to reunite.

23:51.880 --> 23:53.200
But now, we can't go back.

23:53.280 --> 23:56.720
I want to celebrate the festival
with everyone here in the workshop.

23:57.600 --> 23:59.960
I'd like to trouble you to sell all these

24:00.040 --> 24:01.440
and help me buy things

24:01.520 --> 24:03.200
we need for Mid-Autumn.

24:04.240 --> 24:06.960
The remaining money can all go to you.

24:10.520 --> 24:11.360
Well…

24:12.720 --> 24:15.400
you could just report this to Prince Bai.

24:15.920 --> 24:17.520
He'd likely approve.

24:18.360 --> 24:19.600
It's unrelated to brocade.

24:20.120 --> 24:22.720
This is our personal matter.
We'll handle it ourselves.

24:23.240 --> 24:24.600
Handle it yourselves?

24:26.280 --> 24:28.680
But you're using silk
bought by Prince Bai.

24:29.960 --> 24:31.320
What do you call this?

24:32.560 --> 24:34.880
Colluding with each other,
filling your own pockets!

24:35.400 --> 24:36.400
Chi Hu,

24:37.000 --> 24:39.040
you'd better explain this
to Prince Bai personally.

24:39.720 --> 24:40.720
Guards!

24:40.800 --> 24:41.760
Take these weavers away!

24:41.840 --> 24:43.600
- Yes, sir!
- Wait!

24:51.000 --> 24:53.400
Sir, do you have any idea

24:53.920 --> 24:56.200
how much these velvet flowers

25:07.120 --> 25:09.960
- are worth?
- Mr. Chi Hu surely knows.

25:10.800 --> 25:13.480
These velvet flowers
were already valuable in Yizhou.

25:13.560 --> 25:15.520
Now, in Nanzhao,

25:15.600 --> 25:17.720
- they're even rarer.
- Exactly.

25:17.800 --> 25:19.640
The price would multiply several times.

25:20.520 --> 25:21.720
These things

25:22.440 --> 25:23.560
are worth that much?

25:24.440 --> 25:25.400
Of course.

25:27.080 --> 25:29.400
Sir, are you thinking of taking a cut?

25:31.280 --> 25:32.320
Ms. Ji,

25:32.840 --> 25:33.760
that's unacceptable.

25:33.840 --> 25:36.200
Why should he get a cut?

25:36.280 --> 25:37.160
Yeah, Yingying,

25:38.240 --> 25:39.640
we can't cooperate with him!

25:39.720 --> 25:40.920
Since we've been discovered,

25:41.000 --> 25:42.680
cooperation is the best option.

25:42.760 --> 25:44.240
- Shut up.
- Cooperation?

25:44.760 --> 25:47.160
Did I say I wanted to cooperate with you?

25:48.520 --> 25:50.400
I could easily report them.

25:51.880 --> 25:53.320
That's also fine.

25:53.840 --> 25:54.680
But…

25:55.200 --> 25:57.560
we haven't sold these items yet.

25:57.640 --> 25:59.200
Even if you report them,

25:59.280 --> 26:02.120
we can claim they're gifts for Prince Bai.

26:03.360 --> 26:04.760
I just think,

26:04.840 --> 26:06.160
only a fool

26:07.480 --> 26:08.800
wouldn't make profit.

26:12.920 --> 26:15.360
Even though these are valuable,

26:16.080 --> 26:17.120
will we get caught

26:17.840 --> 26:19.200
selling it on the sly?

26:23.760 --> 26:27.000
There are no marks on the velvet flowers,
no labels either.

26:27.080 --> 26:28.960
No one can trace their origin.

26:31.440 --> 26:32.280
How do we split it?

26:35.280 --> 26:36.480
He takes six, you three,

26:36.560 --> 26:40.360
and I get one share
to buy lanterns and mooncake tools.

26:41.640 --> 26:43.360
Why does he get twice as much as me?

26:44.400 --> 26:46.280
By order, he came before you.

26:46.880 --> 26:48.080
By association,

26:48.600 --> 26:50.560
he tormented us less than you did.

26:51.240 --> 26:53.680
By capability,
he's better at smuggling them out.

26:57.880 --> 26:59.440
I'll handle the transport.

26:59.520 --> 27:02.600
I take six, he takes three.
Otherwise, no deal.

27:02.680 --> 27:03.680
The business can fall through,

27:03.760 --> 27:05.400
but rules cannot be broken.

27:05.480 --> 27:07.200
He gets five, you four.

27:12.160 --> 27:13.360
I get five,

27:14.440 --> 27:15.280
and he gets four.

27:17.280 --> 27:19.680
Let's ask Mr. Chi Hu what he thinks.

27:23.280 --> 27:24.240
Fine.

27:25.040 --> 27:27.520
You get five, and I get four.

27:42.760 --> 27:44.240
Do we really have to do this?

27:44.320 --> 27:47.120
Qingping Officer
wants to make things difficult for them.

27:47.640 --> 27:49.360
That's separate.

27:49.880 --> 27:51.600
I'll take the money,

27:51.680 --> 27:54.520
but I'll still carry out the punishments.

27:56.040 --> 27:57.080
Send them out.

27:57.680 --> 27:58.600
Understood!

27:58.680 --> 28:00.520
You all, come with me!

28:08.080 --> 28:09.120
Tell her

28:10.080 --> 28:11.840
I also don't like

28:12.360 --> 28:14.160
having someone else's dog

28:14.240 --> 28:17.080
barking on my territory every day.

28:19.480 --> 28:21.840
But we can use these velvet flowers

28:21.920 --> 28:23.640
to turn the tables.

28:27.040 --> 28:28.120
By the way,

28:28.200 --> 28:31.160
did she mention Yang Jinglan?

28:32.160 --> 28:33.200
No, she didn't.

28:36.320 --> 28:38.920
Ji Yingying once endured ten years

28:39.000 --> 28:40.520
to avenge her father.

28:41.520 --> 28:42.880
Given her character,

28:42.960 --> 28:44.400
the less she speaks about it,

28:44.920 --> 28:46.520
the more it weighs on her heart.

28:48.680 --> 28:50.000
Forgetting someone

28:50.080 --> 28:52.200
does take time.

28:54.600 --> 28:56.720
I can't kill Yang Jinglan,

28:56.800 --> 29:00.120
but I can make his life a living hell.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.200
Give me that.

29:13.280 --> 29:14.160
Yingying,

29:15.600 --> 29:16.760
you invited us
to celebrate Mid-Autumn Festival?

29:18.080 --> 29:20.360
I've prepared mooncake molds,

29:20.440 --> 29:23.000
osmanthus wine, and lanterns.

29:23.080 --> 29:24.760
Later, you can light lanterns

29:24.840 --> 29:26.080
or make mooncakes.

29:27.720 --> 29:28.880
I want to go home.

29:30.840 --> 29:32.560
Mid-Autumn is a time for family reunions,

29:33.400 --> 29:34.920
but we're stuck in this awful place.

29:35.000 --> 29:36.600
How can we feel like celebrating?

29:37.640 --> 29:39.720
Are we supposed
to treat this place as home?

29:40.360 --> 29:41.480
No.

29:41.560 --> 29:44.520
I hope that missing our hometown

29:44.600 --> 29:46.840
can give us strength,
help us pull ourselves together,

29:48.080 --> 29:49.400
unite as one,

29:49.480 --> 29:51.320
and leave this place

29:51.400 --> 29:52.480
to get back home soon.

29:55.160 --> 29:56.000
Yingying…

29:58.920 --> 30:00.440
Yingying, um…

30:00.520 --> 30:01.680
the other day,

30:02.200 --> 30:04.400
I spoke too harshly to you.
Please don't take it to heart.

30:07.440 --> 30:09.080
About weaving brocade
for the Nanzhao people,

30:09.160 --> 30:11.640
I've thought it over for days.
You're right.

30:13.680 --> 30:15.400
But I still can't accept

30:15.920 --> 30:17.600
being enslaved like this.

30:18.360 --> 30:21.000
I'm also worried once we kneel,

30:21.960 --> 30:23.800
even if we return home,

30:25.080 --> 30:26.360
we may never stand tall again.

30:28.520 --> 30:30.840
It's like tonight's moon,

30:31.960 --> 30:33.320
hidden behind the cloud,

30:33.960 --> 30:35.080
no longer shining.

30:36.360 --> 30:37.800
We're here!

30:40.320 --> 30:41.160
We're here.

30:42.160 --> 30:44.000
- Come on!
- They're here.

30:48.960 --> 30:50.320
I called everyone.

30:50.400 --> 30:51.720
I went door to door.

30:51.800 --> 30:52.720
No one's missing.

30:54.560 --> 30:56.400
Well, let me say a few words.

30:56.960 --> 30:58.600
Today is Mid-Autumn Festival,

30:58.680 --> 31:00.720
a time when the moon is full. We…

31:02.960 --> 31:05.640
Although there's no moon,
it doesn't matter.

31:05.720 --> 31:07.120
Let's just celebrate together.

31:08.440 --> 31:09.400
No moon?

31:11.040 --> 31:13.640
Then, maybe this festival
isn't meant for you!

31:17.520 --> 31:18.440
Ji Yingying,

31:19.640 --> 31:21.280
you're not working

31:21.360 --> 31:22.640
but gathering here to cause trouble

31:22.720 --> 31:24.360
and colluding with outsiders

31:24.440 --> 31:25.560
to smuggle goods!

31:25.640 --> 31:28.160
You've truly betrayed
His Majesty's trust in you.

31:28.880 --> 31:31.440
It's an act of deceiving, a crime

31:32.240 --> 31:33.640
- deserving of death!
- Hey,

31:33.720 --> 31:35.560
you clearly agreed to buy these!

31:35.640 --> 31:37.200
That item and that item as well!

31:37.280 --> 31:38.760
Do you have evidence?

31:38.840 --> 31:39.960
- I…
- I called the people.

31:40.560 --> 31:42.520
I bought the things.
It has nothing to do with Yingying!

31:42.600 --> 31:44.600
No, it doesn't. I bought the items.
It has nothing to do with him!

31:44.680 --> 31:45.720
Everyone, shut up!

31:50.080 --> 31:51.120
Ji Yingying,

31:52.120 --> 31:53.800
what kind of spell did you cast on them?

31:54.560 --> 31:56.680
You can't even protect yourself now.

31:57.240 --> 31:58.120
Fine.

31:59.360 --> 32:01.560
Since you're all so united,

32:03.280 --> 32:05.320
- take them all out and execute them!
- Understood!

32:05.400 --> 32:06.280
Wait!

32:11.120 --> 32:12.200
Sir,

32:12.760 --> 32:13.760
you're just in time.

32:15.520 --> 32:16.840
Sheng Fengze,

32:16.920 --> 32:19.280
I know you're here.
Come out and save them!

32:25.760 --> 32:27.520
Ms. Ji, you're truly clever.

32:27.600 --> 32:29.320
You even guessed this would happen.

32:31.800 --> 32:33.200
- Chi Hu.
- Here.

32:33.280 --> 32:34.960
- Seize them.
- Seize them!

32:36.240 --> 32:37.080
Your Highness,

32:37.160 --> 32:38.760
what crime have I committed?

32:43.640 --> 32:45.560
You forced the artisans in the workshop

32:45.640 --> 32:46.880
to make velvet flowers for you

32:46.960 --> 32:48.480
and sold them privately.

32:48.560 --> 32:49.480
You abused your power for personal gain!

32:49.560 --> 32:52.800
The soldiers transporting
and merchants purchasing

32:52.880 --> 32:54.200
have all confessed.

32:54.280 --> 32:55.520
There's both proof and witnesses!

32:57.280 --> 32:59.320
Out of mercy,
and because this is your first offense,

32:59.400 --> 33:00.440
you will be punished with 50 lashes.

33:00.520 --> 33:02.720
- But you also…
- What about me?

33:03.920 --> 33:05.280
Do you have proof against me?

33:08.920 --> 33:12.320
CONFESSION

33:13.080 --> 33:13.960
Fine.

33:15.520 --> 33:17.280
I admit to selling velvet flowers,

33:17.880 --> 33:19.640
but I had them brought from Yizhou.

33:20.240 --> 33:22.200
It has nothing to do
with the artisans here!

33:23.000 --> 33:25.240
Those velvet flowers
are called "Flushed Rose".

33:25.320 --> 33:26.400
I dyed them myself.

33:27.840 --> 33:30.160
Just a few days ago,
I found them a bit plain,

33:30.240 --> 33:32.000
so I added lighter colors

33:32.080 --> 33:34.240
to every one made in Nanzhao.

33:34.880 --> 33:37.440
If you can find
the same color scheme in Yizhou,

33:37.520 --> 33:38.840
then I'm slandering you.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.320
If you can't,

33:40.840 --> 33:42.280
then admit your guilt.

33:45.600 --> 33:46.880
Fine…

33:48.440 --> 33:50.080
You've been scheming against me
from the start.

33:53.560 --> 33:55.760
- Take him away!
- Wait a moment.

34:00.160 --> 34:02.360
Prince Bai, since you're punishing him,

34:02.440 --> 34:05.880
may we, his victims,
have a chance for revenge?

34:13.280 --> 34:15.440
He's one of Du Yan's men.

34:16.280 --> 34:17.679
I think

34:19.679 --> 34:21.040
that's a great idea.

34:35.360 --> 34:36.960
Hit him twice for me,

34:37.040 --> 34:38.239
for yourselves,

34:38.320 --> 34:40.239
and for all the artisans he bullied.

34:40.880 --> 34:42.199
Hit him!

34:44.040 --> 34:44.880
Go on!

34:49.239 --> 34:50.120
Hit him!

34:52.040 --> 34:53.239
You wouldn't dare!

34:53.840 --> 34:54.960
Hit him!

34:55.040 --> 34:56.040
Your Highness,

34:56.679 --> 34:58.280
I'm the Qingping Officer's person.

34:58.800 --> 35:00.160
I'll accept your punishment,

35:00.680 --> 35:02.800
but how can you let these Yizhou peasants…

35:17.400 --> 35:18.240
Who are you calling peasants?

35:19.840 --> 35:21.200
Who are you calling peasants?

35:21.880 --> 35:23.280
Who's a peasant?

35:23.800 --> 35:25.040
- Who's a peasant?
- Hit him!

35:25.120 --> 35:26.560
- Who's a peasant?
- How about that?

35:26.640 --> 35:27.480
- Brothers.
- I'll help you hit him!

35:27.560 --> 35:28.400
- Who's a peasant?
- How about that?

35:29.000 --> 35:30.000
Who's a peasant?

35:30.080 --> 35:31.320
Who's a peasant?

35:31.400 --> 35:32.440
You like drawing swords, huh?

35:32.520 --> 35:33.960
You enjoy drawing blades, huh?

35:37.400 --> 35:39.000
Are you out of your mind, huh?

35:39.600 --> 35:42.400
Come on, hit him!

35:42.480 --> 35:44.280
- Hit him!
- Hit him!

35:46.040 --> 35:47.320
This is for picking on us!

35:47.400 --> 35:48.760
This is for bullying us!

35:54.720 --> 35:55.600
Let's go.

36:08.200 --> 36:09.120
Drag him out.

36:09.200 --> 36:10.360
Fifty lashes!

36:19.840 --> 36:20.920
Prince Bai,

36:21.440 --> 36:23.360
since we're weaving brocade here,

36:23.880 --> 36:26.760
shouldn't we be given
proper working conditions?

36:28.280 --> 36:30.560
Agreed. What do you want?

36:31.160 --> 36:32.000
First,

36:32.080 --> 36:33.880
the guards here should only restrict us

36:33.960 --> 36:35.240
from leaving this place.

36:35.320 --> 36:36.400
They must not interfere otherwise,

36:36.480 --> 36:38.480
nor insult or beat the artisans.

36:42.320 --> 36:44.040
Alright, I agree.

36:44.680 --> 36:45.600
Second,

36:45.680 --> 36:47.560
the artisans' basic living needs

36:47.640 --> 36:49.080
should match those in Yizhou.

36:49.160 --> 36:51.160
We must have enough food, proper clothing,

36:51.240 --> 36:52.280
and medical care.

36:53.840 --> 36:55.360
Of course.

36:55.440 --> 36:57.000
I agree with that as well.

36:58.240 --> 36:59.360
One last thing.

37:00.480 --> 37:03.560
Please allow each of us
to write a letter home.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.720
This request…

37:13.920 --> 37:15.760
I might not be able to grant it.

37:16.880 --> 37:18.400
You don't understand.

37:18.480 --> 37:20.040
Right now, in Yizhou,

37:20.120 --> 37:21.520
Niu Jin holds all the power.

37:22.040 --> 37:23.520
He's declared himself
Military Commissioner.

37:24.600 --> 37:26.200
Not only are letters from Nanzhao blocked,

37:26.280 --> 37:29.280
even letters from Chang'an
can't get through.

37:29.360 --> 37:30.440
Moreover,

37:30.520 --> 37:33.600
he's been exploiting
Yizhou's brocade industry.

37:33.680 --> 37:36.280
Right now, the artisans in Yizhou

37:36.800 --> 37:38.440
are living far worse than you.

37:46.680 --> 37:49.160
So… I think it's better for you

37:49.240 --> 37:50.560
not to return to Yizhou for now.

37:50.640 --> 37:52.800
Stay here in Nanzhao for a while.

37:58.840 --> 38:00.240
No matter how chaotic Yizhou gets,

38:00.760 --> 38:02.360
it's still our home.

38:03.280 --> 38:04.880
We'll return there someday.

38:07.640 --> 38:10.640
Do you know why I didn't take advantage
of today's opportunity

38:10.720 --> 38:13.000
to drive Du Yan's men out?

38:20.760 --> 38:22.360
Such exquisite items…

38:22.440 --> 38:24.800
Are they really made
in the weaving workshop?

38:24.880 --> 38:26.000
They are.

38:26.800 --> 38:27.640
However,

38:28.160 --> 38:30.640
as delicate and beautiful
as these velvet flowers are,

38:30.720 --> 38:34.040
they're nowhere near
as valuable as Shu brocade.

38:35.600 --> 38:36.520
Right now,

38:36.600 --> 38:38.200
the top priority for the weaving workshop

38:38.280 --> 38:41.280
is to produce our Nanzhao brocade.

38:47.840 --> 38:49.240
Since he abused his power

38:49.320 --> 38:50.360
and delayed brocade production,

38:50.440 --> 38:51.880
deal with him as you see fit.

38:53.040 --> 38:53.920
Is it because

38:54.000 --> 38:56.040
you don't dare to deal
with the Qingping Officer's people

38:56.560 --> 38:58.560
that you came to me?

39:02.920 --> 39:04.200
Actually,

39:04.280 --> 39:05.800
this is Ji Yingying's plan.

39:06.960 --> 39:08.240
That head guard

39:09.040 --> 39:11.560
bullied the Yizhou artisans

39:11.640 --> 39:12.800
far too cruelly.

39:13.400 --> 39:15.960
Ji Yingying wanted to lift their spirits

39:16.040 --> 39:19.120
so they could focus on weaving brocade.

39:19.200 --> 39:21.080
That man had to go.

39:21.920 --> 39:22.920
So,

39:23.440 --> 39:26.040
Ji Yingying and I seized this opportunity

39:26.120 --> 39:28.120
and presented it to you, Your Majesty.

39:32.320 --> 39:33.520
You're quite honest.

39:35.560 --> 39:36.800
Between you and me,

39:36.880 --> 39:39.240
we're not just lord and subject,
we're also brothers.

39:39.320 --> 39:40.680
We're family.

39:40.760 --> 39:42.000
I don't need to hide anything from you.

39:45.920 --> 39:46.920
Alright.

39:47.440 --> 39:48.840
If that's the case,

39:49.960 --> 39:51.400
for the next year,

39:51.920 --> 39:53.760
I'll put you in charge

39:53.840 --> 39:55.360
of all brocade production.

39:58.600 --> 40:02.360
Actually, that wasn't my intention.

40:03.200 --> 40:04.680
Then, what is your intention?

40:05.280 --> 40:07.080
With this one-year agreement,

40:07.160 --> 40:08.720
I'll do my best.

40:11.040 --> 40:11.920
However,

40:12.000 --> 40:13.640
it's unavoidable

40:14.880 --> 40:16.520
that someone will try to cause trouble.

40:17.840 --> 40:18.840
So,

40:18.920 --> 40:21.600
I wish to work with Qingping Officer.

40:22.160 --> 40:24.000
If the brocade is completed,
we'll share the rewards.

40:24.080 --> 40:26.440
If it isn't,

40:26.520 --> 40:27.360
we'll share the blame.

40:31.120 --> 40:32.960
If you force them to withdraw openly,

40:33.040 --> 40:35.840
they'll secretly try to undermine you.

40:37.000 --> 40:39.360
Only by making them
share both the rewards and punishments

40:39.440 --> 40:41.200
will they stop making reckless moves

40:42.040 --> 40:43.480
and truly step aside.

40:46.200 --> 40:47.800
You understand me

40:47.880 --> 40:50.680
because you and I
are the same kind of person.

40:51.680 --> 40:53.880
Then, why do you always act

40:54.400 --> 40:56.760
like you're the good guy
and I'm the bad guy,

40:56.840 --> 40:57.960
keeping me at arm's length?

41:02.520 --> 41:03.800
Thank you

41:05.160 --> 41:06.000
for today's help.

41:06.080 --> 41:07.880
We still have a festival to celebrate.

41:08.400 --> 41:09.680
Please excuse yourself.

41:10.320 --> 41:13.000
As the princess consort,
won't you invite me to join?

41:13.080 --> 41:14.760
Have you forgotten

41:14.840 --> 41:17.120
why we're celebrating here at all?

41:54.600 --> 41:55.520
Everyone,

41:56.640 --> 41:58.360
I trust that a king

41:58.440 --> 41:59.880
wouldn't break his word.

42:01.160 --> 42:04.840
All I can do is fight for as much freedom
and dignity as possible.

42:05.760 --> 42:08.120
I want to give my all to weave the brocade

42:08.200 --> 42:09.960
and take everyone home.

42:11.520 --> 42:13.080
Will you trust me?

42:18.120 --> 42:19.040
Home!

42:20.200 --> 42:21.400
I want to go home!

42:22.160 --> 42:24.520
Ji Yingying, take me home!

42:25.120 --> 42:26.320
- Home!
- We want to go home!

42:26.400 --> 42:27.760
- We want to go home!
- Home!

42:27.840 --> 42:28.960
- Yingying, take us home!
- Take us home!

42:29.040 --> 42:29.880
- Home!
- Home!

42:29.960 --> 42:31.560
- We want to go home!
- Home!

42:31.640 --> 42:34.040
- Home!
- Take us home!

42:34.120 --> 42:36.320
- Home!
- Home!

42:36.400 --> 42:38.160
- Home!
- Take us home!

42:38.240 --> 42:39.880
- Pin, we're going home!
- Home!

42:39.960 --> 42:40.840
Home!

42:40.920 --> 42:41.880
Home!

42:41.960 --> 42:42.800
Home!

42:42.880 --> 42:44.360
- Home!
- Wait!

42:44.440 --> 42:45.760
What is it?

42:47.440 --> 42:48.480
Look,

42:49.200 --> 42:50.120
the moon…

42:51.680 --> 42:52.800
It's out.
